@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@token = YOUR_JWT_TOKEN

# Auth: cookie OR Bearer - server checks Cookie first, then Bearer
# Use either: Cookie: token={{token}} OR Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get Tafsir - Logged User (optionalAuth - cookie OR Bearer)
POST {{baseUrl}}/tafsir
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: token={{token}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "ayah": "الله لا إله إلا هو الحي القيوم"
}

### Get Tafsir - Guest (no token)
POST {{baseUrl}}/tafsir
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ayah": "الله لا إله إلا هو الحي القيوم"
}
